  "name": "Scimitar Master",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/weapons/swords/scimitar-guard-gold.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The light and curved blade allows the wielder to make complex flourishes to rend their enemies. You gain the following benefits while wielding a scimitar:</p><ul><li>You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls you make with scimitar.</li><li>As a bonus action, you can make a flourish with your next attack made with a scimitar. When you hit, the attack gains a damage spread of 5ft, DC = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength or Dexterity modifier. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, regaining all uses at the end of a short or long rest.</li><li>If you move 10ft in a straight line towards a creature before making an attack with a scimitar, when the attack hits, you deal an additional damage die with the attack.</li><li>If a creature hits a creature within your melee reach with a melee attack, you can use your reaction to become the target instead.</li></ul>",
